{"name": "DeGen Rivals", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"369\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/bd3cf465e344007be779f07c0d15d22f.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"1245\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"954\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/82b06efd53a47f41f003a5dc60580903.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enter a universe created by the \u201cDr.\u201d, a mad scientist whose crazy DNA experiments created the ultimate DeGens from a mix of traits extracted from whatever he could get his hands on. His experiment has gone off the rails, and now the DeGens are on a rampage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"419\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/2aa9d35b52c6e7c6f1311b0b676bfafe.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"1377\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"954\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/29a6e72534971a69d4794319a38fc1f0.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle it out with the DeGens in fast-paced casual matches for domination using blasters, a variety of crazy Power-ups, and your own vehicle as you weaponize the physics to crash, bash, and smash your Rivals to victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"311\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/4bfd8e99c15375314f456be767a11349.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"1275\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"954\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/7cc4538e8aee325a20520334bfcd5c35.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wreck your rivals, outrun \u201cThe Crush\u201d, and be the last kart rolling in the core Battle Royale mode. Test your tactics in Demolition Party objective-based gamemodes like \u201cCops n' Robbers\u201d, \u201cLoot Smash\u201d, and \u201cOrder Up!\u201d</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"324\" src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/9f9b510f11cf13b5cfd63c7834b3de27.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"1269\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"534\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.poster.avif?t=1773402345\" width=\"954\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.webm?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4132610/extras/889a17e6a70f6b536d882d64e8e20ff6.mp4?t=1773402345\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Between the beatdowns, DeGenerate your own unique avatar in the Lab and trick out your ride in the Garage with infinite combinations.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GAME FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>MODES OF CHAOS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Smash rivals in quickplay or host private lobbies across a variety of chaotic game modes and levels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SMASH CASH REWARDS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete Daily Quests to earn Smash Cash, level up, and unlock exclusive rewards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>GUILDS &amp; GLORY</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Form a Guild, climb the leaderboards, and compete for dominance in Seasonal Tournaments.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>CROSS-PLATFORM BATTLE</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fight friends or rivals on PC and Mobile in seamless online lobbies.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "The ultimate Kart-based Battle Royale. Smash your Rivals in free-to-play, 8-player online chaos across a variety of wild levels an